#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500376"
msgid "The door to the Infirmary doesn't exist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500560"
msgid "The breeze against my cheeks feels pleasant.\nWind in the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF is a recreation of wind on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500920"
msgid "I hadn't noticed #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501276"
msgid "That's not true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501600"
msgid "H-hey, enough about me! I want to hear\nmore about you, Senpai!\nLook, it's just… us here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501800"
msgid "…about me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501816"
msgid "There's not much to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501864"
msgid "Anything will do.\nI personally love when you talk to\nme about mundane things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501948"
msgid "Is that so?\nSince #C236196003Sakura#CDEF asked, I guess I have to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502332"
msgid "Then, I share my reactions to #C236196003BB#CDEF's bizarre channel\nand of my many experiences throughout the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502480"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502548"
msgid "That's indicative of just how much time I spent here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502728"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF speaks calmly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502836"
msgid "No.\nSomewhere more proper for you.\nA tranquil yet harsh world in conflict."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503356"
msgid "Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503364"
msgid "Can I ask one last thing?\nWhat are you fighting for?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "503428"
msgid "For survival."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503532"
msgid "I can't sugarcoat it.\n\"Survival\" is always in the back of my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503608"
msgid "I can't die here.\nI can't accept myself dying here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504208"
msgid "Good night, Senpai.\nI'll be helping you again tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504392"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504408"
msgid "I made up my mind long ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504588"
msgid "You're including me, I see.\nI told you it's not necessary though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504888"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF suffered to help us.\nShe kept it secret, enduring it all alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504980"
msgid "To me, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF isn't a health management AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "505112"
msgid "That's why I swore:\n\"I'll protect you.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "505236"
msgid "―――, ―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "505792"
msgid "―――, ―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "505876"
msgid "―――However, an AI can't delete itself.\nSuicide isn't allowed for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506348"
msgid "―――Still.\nStill, please forgive me."
msgstr ""

