#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535096"
msgid "I look around the school building at night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535140"
msgid "Peeking inside the Student Council Room,\nI see #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF sleeping in their chairs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535260"
msgid "I lay blankets over them, then leave the\nStudent Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535324"
msgid "The Commissary is closed.\nI guess #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF is in sleep mode."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535404"
msgid "Suddenly, something white slips into view.\nA cherry blossom leaf flutters through the\nwindow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535500"
msgid "The breeze must be pretty nice at night.\nI'll go take a walk through the schoolyard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535588"
msgid "――――I enter the schoolyard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535620"
msgid "A digital wind formed of numerical values,\nindistinguishable from the real thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535704"
msgid "Can it be called \"real\"?\nOr should it be called \"something virtual that's better\nthan the real thing\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535808"
msgid "It's a philosophical question―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535840"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF? What's the matter?\nIt's so early. Everyone else is resting\nin preparation for tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535952"
msgid "Is she real or fake? A human or an AI?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535992"
msgid "The classification depends on the observer.\nTo said person, everything they see before them is real.\nThere's no \"real\" or \"fake\" in regard to their emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536152"
msgid "Ah… okay.\nYou were too nervous to sleep, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536204"
msgid "Sorry. I still don't understand such subtleties\nof the mind. …well, rather than \"still,\"\nI \"ultimately\" never understood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536328"
msgid "I think #C236196003Sakura#CDEF sells herself short.\nI want her to be more confident\nand proud of her abilities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536440"
msgid "Even if she's an AI. Because she's an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536484"
msgid "If there are things only humans can do,\nthen I expect that there are things only AI can do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536576"
msgid "I-I suppose. My processing speeds are fast,\nI have tight emotional control, and I possess\nnear-full freedom within imaginary regions…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536712"
msgid "H-hey, enough about me!\nMore importantly, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…\nSenpai, can I hear more about yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536820"
msgid "I talk about what I felt each day since I came to the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536884"
msgid "About the old-fashioned feeling of the\nschool building and its calm ambience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536964"
msgid "About the frightening atmosphere of the Labyrinth\nand its gorgeous sights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537040"
msgid "I talk about what makes #C236196003#SVT#CDEF,\nwhom I depend on, so great."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537116"
msgid "About my impressions of the Student Council\nthat #C236196003Leo#CDEF formed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537196"
msgid "I talked about the atmosphere of the Student Council Room\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF work together in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537344"
msgid "As I speak, I surprisingly don't\nrun out of topics to discuss."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537408"
msgid "Yes. You're the same Senpai I remember.\nYou're too good of a person to\nbe in a place like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537504"
msgid "There's a place where you truly belong\nand must return to, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537572"
msgid "A place I must return to…\nI guess she's referring to the Near Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537676"
msgid "Please don't forget where #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF is\nactually located. Don't forget the person\nyour#RUBS strength#RUBE heart#REND is supporting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537820"
msgid "The stars twinkle.\nThe sea undulates."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537860"
msgid "She sways in the wind of the nighttime\nschoolyard like a measly flower."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537932"
msgid "…we've been talking for a little too long.\nYou need to get back to sleep soon or else\ntomorrow will prove more difficult."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538056"
msgid "I nod in affirmation. \nThis night may be peaceful, but in a few hours,\nwe'll be back to battle as usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538164"
msgid "I'd like to stay longer, but I need to get back and rest."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "538224"
msgid "To return to the Holy Grail War."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "538260"
msgid "For us and for Sakura."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "538284"
msgid "For us and for Sakura.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538328"
msgid "In that sense, battles in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\nand battles in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF are all the same to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538472"
msgid "I'm not fighting to beat anyone.\nI'm fighting to keep on living."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538540"
msgid "To return the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF to how it's supposed to be.\nThat seems to me like the most correct and significant motive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538676"
msgid "I'm not the only one facing this problem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538720"
msgid "Many Masters lost their lives up to this point.\nMany wishes were made and left unfulfilled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538812"
msgid "As one Master who competed with them,\nI can't stand by and pretend they never existed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538900"
msgid "…I'm glad to hear that.\nYour motives are just."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538948"
msgid "I was a bit worried that you might say\nsomething strange again, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539024"
msgid "Leaving #C236196003Sakura#CDEF behind in the schoolyard,\nI go back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539104"
msgid "Talking with her calmed me down.\nI should sleep soundly now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539168"
msgid "I'm fighting for myself.\nThose around me are so precious;\nI #RUBS won't#RUBEcan't#REND go down so easily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539276"
msgid "If I was the only person that mattered to me,\nI wouldn't have made it this far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539356"
msgid "…I hesitate a bit.\nI hesitate, but come right on out and say it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539424"
msgid "It's not that I'm including #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is the person I want to protect the most."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539544"
msgid "On the \"second day\" that I only faintly recall,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539628"
msgid "She's an irreplaceable ally and a #[girl][friend]# worthy of respect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539700"
msgid "Despite saying she has no need for love,\nshe's kindly showed concern for all of us this entire time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539804"
msgid "I-I'm sorry. The night breeze may have\nblew something into my eye…\nI'm quite the puzzling one, aren't I?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539912"
msgid "Thank you very much.\nHearing you say that now makes me want to\nwork harder to help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539996"
msgid "I apologize for stopping you here to talk.\nGood night, Senpai. We'll see each other\ntomorrow in the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540120"
msgid "I nod then go through the entrance.\nLeaving #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in the schoolyard,\nI head up to My Room on the second floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540248"
msgid "I've surprisingly calmed down a lot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540288"
msgid "…oh.\nEverything I just said to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF are things\nI wanted to tell her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540376"
msgid "―――Now I really have no unfinished business left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540432"
msgid "I'll go back to My Room and prepare for the final battle.\nI'm sure I'll sleep like a baby tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540532"
msgid "―――If I knew it would be this painful,\nI would've preferred to be deleted sooner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540620"
msgid "We were created to record.\nWe don't have the functionality to self-delete.\nThat's why―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540712"
msgid "…once we face #C236196003BB#CDEF, none of us will be spared.\nI'm sure that Senpai and the others will win.\nThey won't lose, not even against #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540876"
msgid "That's why――they'll disappear.\nEach, and every… Once they leave this place,\nevery one of them will die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540984"
msgid "That's how it should be.\nAs a being of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nI see no contradiction in that result."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541096"
msgid "If there's a god in this world, hear this:\nplease overlook my selfish choices\nand my heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541188"
msgid "I ended up forsaking love.\nI don't know what it is.\nRather, I'm not allowed to comprehend it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541284"
msgid "I threw away that #ROFS0002#RUBS memory#RUBErecord#REND.\nI have no right to any reward.\nLogically, it would also be wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541408"
msgid "But―――that's fine.\nIt's fine if I can never understand,\nand it's fine if I'm never rewarded."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541504"
msgid "Regardless, even if I become separated\nfrom the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nfrom my cherished one, I―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541612"
msgid "―――Ahh, I see.\nSo this feeling, this is it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541660"
msgid "…#C236196003BB#CDEF.\nYou came to the same conclusion, right?\n\"To protect #[him][her]# at any cost.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541764"
msgid "…now I understand.\nNo, now I finally understand.\nFinally I do, villainous as I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541848"
msgid "―――I will be the one to protect #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541900"
msgid "No matter what awaits me in the end. I'm going\nto send #[him][her]# back to where #[he][she]# belongs,\neven if it breaks me―――"
msgstr ""

